OL,3,GNEWSAMicrosoft scrambles to solve
OL,4,Aglobal outage affecting Outlook and
OL,5,ATeams but says fixes not going 'as
OL,6,Aexpected'
OL,7,
OL,8,FA Microsoft outage is affecting
OL,9,Fservices including Teams, Outlook and
OL,10,FAI software Copilot - here's what we
OL,11,Fknow
OL,13,FIssues started on Thursday, with
OL,14,Fmonitoring website Downdetector seeing
OL,15,Fproblems reported in more than 70
OL,16,Fcountries
OL,18,FMicrosoft says its attempts to fix the
OL,19,Fissue are not "taking as expected",
OL,20,Fadding that the issue hasn't been
OL,21,Fcaused by a cyber-security breach
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
