OL,3,GNEWSAMicrosoft scrambles to solve
OL,4,Aglobal outage affecting Outlook and
OL,5,ATeams but says fixes not going 'as
OL,6,Aexpected'
OL,7,
OL,8,FUK Parliament says it's affected and
OL,9,F"alternative communication arrangements
OL,10,Fare in place"; an NHS doctor says
OL,11,FMicrosoft services are "central" to GP
OL,12,Fpractices and warns of disruption; in
OL,13,FAustralia, spy and federal police
OL,14,Fagencies also report issues
OL,16,FHow are you affected? Jack, a teacher,
OL,17,Ftells us he can't access emails but
OL,18,Flesson plans are available. Meanwhile,
OL,19,FMartin says it was "bliss" to wake up
OL,20,Fto no emails - before he realised
OL,21,F"today is a crucial day to conclude a
OL,22,Fbusiness deal"
